gamescope (SteamOS session compositing window manager)

gamescope is Valve's micro-compositor that runs on SteamOS and the Steam Deck.
It allows you to upscale games with FidelityFX Super Resolution (FSR),
apply integer scaling, limit FPS with minimal latency, and run Wayland-native
or nested X11 game windows.

Usage:
  gamescope -W 1920 -H 1080 -w 2560 -h 1440 -U -- steam
  gamescope -W 1280 -H 720 -U -F fsr -- %command%
